9400,"stop_ts":1795204800,"duration_minutes":90,"season":null,"episode":null,"episode_title":null,"is_live":false,"is_rerun":false},{"show_id":"x347626023b","start":"2026-11-20T20:00:00Z","stop":"2026-11-20T21:00:00Z","start_ts":1795204800,"stop_ts":1795208400,"duration_minutes":60,"season":null,"episode":null,"episode_title":null,"is_live":false,"is_rerun":false}]},"shows":{"mv37799":{"show_id":"mv37799","tmdb_id":37799,"content_type":"movie","title":"الشبكة الاجتماعية","title_en":"The Social Network","title_fr":null,"original_title":"The Social Network","tagline":"لا يمكنك الوصول إلى 500 مليون صديق دون تكوين بعض الأعداء.","description":"في إحدى ليالي خريف عام 2003 ، جلس مارك زوكربيرج ، جامع جامعي وعبقرية برمجة الكمبيوتر في جامعة هارفارد ، أمام جهاز الكمبيوتر الخاص به وبدأ بحرارة العمل على فكرة جديدة. في خضم موجة من التدوين والبرمجة ، سرعان ما يتحول ما يبدأ في غرفة سكنه كموقع صغير بين الأصدقاء إلى شبكة اجتماعية عالمية وثورة في الاتصال. بعد ست سنوات فقط و 500 مليون صديق ، أصبح مارك زوكربيرج أصغر ملياردير في التاريخ ... لكن بالنسبة لرجل الأعمال هذا ، يؤدي النجاح إلى تعقيدات شخصية وقانونية.","description_en":"In 2003, Harvard undergrad and computer programmer Mark Zuckerberg begins work on a new concept that eventually turns into the global social network known as Facebook. Six years later, Mark is one of the youngest billionaires ever, but his unprecedented success leads to both personal and legal complications when he ends up on the receiving end of two lawsuits, one involving his former friend.","description_fr":"Un soir d'hiver 2003, Mark Zuckerberg, étudiant à Harvard et expert en informatique, s'installe devant son ordinateur et se met à travailler avec frénésie sur une nouvelle idée, autour du développement de programme et de blogs. Ce qui prend forme dans cette chambre ce soir-là deviendra très vite un réseau communautaire à échelle mondiale et une révolution dans la communication. Seulement six années et quelques 500 millions d'amis plus tard, Mark Zuckerberg est devenu le plus jeune milliardaire de l'histoire… Cependant, pour cet entrepreneur, la réussite amène à la fois des complications personnelles et légales.","poster":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/toDPO6Q5AVCCTYrwehbqW44I8Ul.jpg","backdrop":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/1PXwh3nJzgRkkYnqfWInJNypeL4.jpg","has_poster":true,"rating":7.4,"vote_count":13775,"age_rating":"PG-13","year":"2010","release_date":"2010-10-01","runtime_minutes":121,"status":"Released","country":"الولايات المتحدة","language":"الإنجليزية","genres":["دراما","أفلام"],"genre_keys":["drama"],"similar":["mv313369","mv78","mv331482","mv141","mv596","mv271954","mv222935","mv616"],"director":"ديفيد فينشر","cast":[{"name":"جيسي آيزينبيرغ","character":"Mark Zuckerberg","profile_image":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/2ojZrkt5rdkUi857WSeCatxXdGS.jpg"},{"name":"أندرو غارفيلد","character":"Eduardo Saverin","profile_image":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/beO5YvbTjrr5yy8hW26KVDMSr35.jpg"},{"name":"أرمي هامر","character":"Cameron Winklevoss / Tyler Winklevoss","profile_image":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/4Z5nLW2biRjqstDMKqSaeQYAesK.jpg"},{"name":"جاستن تمبرليك","character":"Sean Parker","profile_image":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/6Yk5t9RwkdkAT8Qv45934Eez2CA.jpg"},{"name":"روني مارا","character":"Erica Albright","profile_image":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/zT6UyHFHEQ9RcKykplWCycKBnoS.jpg"},{"name":"Max Minghella","character":"Divya Narendra","profile_image":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/AhVDxsOOoAnwwVBL7ZY8W0mGsYJ.jpg"},{"name":"بريندا سونغ","character":"Christy Ling","profile_image":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/eyYiNWXquotE53lfjsgcwxgfvu.jpg"},{"name":"Josh Pence","character":"Tyler Winklevoss (Body Double)","profile_image":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/tkDFl0BEVCUcwKR30ICeG3yCTbr.jpg"},{"name":"Rashida Jones","character":"Marylin Delpy","profile_image":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/cgWGm9eYCretBWeljPVtpRV7n6V.jpg"},{"name":"John Getz","character":"Sy","profile_image":"https://im